					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511202,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}覺得伯努瓦他是不是陷入了什麼危險？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511203,
					"content": "沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511204,
					"content": "我有種很不好的感覺，我們要不要去報案啊？去和執律庭說一下吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511205,
						741511206,
						741511207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511205,
					"content": "沒有證據。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511208,
					"content": "#這樣啊…{F#妳}{M#你}說的也有道理。總之，我們是要幫助伯努瓦的對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511209,
					"content": "小茉莉拜託過我們，要告訴伯努瓦他給的點心非常好吃，我們答應過她。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511210,
					"content": "我們會做到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511211,
					"content": "#我就知道{F#妳}{M#你}說到做到，而且腦袋聰明！那我們接下來怎麼做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511212,
					"content": "去調查一番吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511213,
					"content": "就由我們來弄清楚到底發生了什麼吧！唔…具體來說，我們要調查些什麼啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511214,
						741511215,
						741511216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511214,
					"content": "這對夫婦的身分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511217,
					"content": "#對對對，真相就由我們來揭穿吧！名偵探派蒙、{NICKNAME}出動！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741511215,
					"content": "這對夫婦的目的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511216,
					"content": "伯努瓦對他們的態度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511206,
					"content": "事情還不明朗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741511207,
					"content": "不知道伯努瓦的態度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741511208
					]
				}
